     "delimiter": "COMMA",
     "header_lines": [
      {
       "cells": [
        "# FIXTURE: a stand-in for the planted S# bank of plan # (plan #",
        "amendment A# ruling Q#)"
       ],
       "line": 1
      },
      {
       "cells": [],
       "line": 2
      },
      {
       "cells": [
        "Every file under S#/ is EMPTY. The names are the bank's: # curve files S#_c#npz to S#_c#npz",
        "MANIFEST.json and truth.json. No value"
       ],
       "line": 3
      },
      {
       "cells": [
        "of the bank is here",
        "and no file here was copied from it. `bin/cc intake seal dial#-s# --universe <this directory>` seals the worked"
       ],
       "line": 4
      },
      {
       "cells": [
        "example against these names and sizes (all #)",
        "so SEAL.json records `location_name = \"p#-bank-FIXTURE\"`: a seal against the real bank"
       ],
       "line": 5
      },
      {
       "cells": [
        "names its own directory. A data stage run against this fixture would read empty files; every data stage is a STUB in plan #"
       ],
       "line": 6
      }
     ],
